# commit A: dump the wire request of the first error a fallback absorbs
# Covers both absorption seams: non-retryable client errors (agent/turn_api_error.py
# non-retryable branch) and the retryable ladder exhausting max_retries (429/transport).
# Dedupe: one dump per (session, provider, model, classified reason) per process.
# Apply: git apply dump-first-nonretryable.patch
# Test:  scripts/run_tests.sh tests/agent/test_nonretryable_fallback_dump.py

--- a/agent/turn_recovery.py
